      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:32:00Z",
      "textHash": "401234f26879c980daa5af5158edd2c4accb5e1c5cf1297e068143be3fbc7419"
    },
    {
      "key": "01e24a8",
      "nodeTitle": "france_npc",
      "sourceText": "Так, це мій прапор! Мерсі!",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes, that is my flag! Merci!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_01e24a8.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:31:48Z",
      "textHash": "0234ddeb7894af7a770f5a12006570e6bb51d1c2b96684efcc8a015ae85db4b4"
    },
    {
      "key": "02114ba",
      "nodeTitle": "luxembourg_npc",
      "sourceText": "Столиця Люксембургу — це... Люксембург!",
      "sourceEnText": "The Capital of Luxemburg is... Luxemburg!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_02114ba.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 4441,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:32:54Z",
      "textHash": "15a5b63c6e6edf0f6dcb7efea095c067ff51619cd57763ae460ec41f90f14fbb"
    },
    {
      "key": "0278d00",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_italy",
      "sourceText": "В Італії є піца та паста.",
      "sourceEnText": "In Italy there is pizza and pasta.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0278d00.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:33:45Z",
      "textHash": "98bcd0e29d4d2dc867f31e81e208be1c07864d333b823d6dae45bc3dee975f35"
    },
    {
      "key": "02846e8",
      "nodeTitle": "andorra",
      "sourceText": "Мій прапор синьо-жовто-червоний.",
      "sourceEnText": "My flag is blue, yellow, and red.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_02846e8.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:31:40Z",
      "textHash": "491e4bf7e73fc0258a347c9573b03eb8c4b5a225c13fc3cea6964c75caed9bb8"
    },
    {
      "key": "029ee72",
      "nodeTitle": "task_germany",
      "sourceText": "Знайдіть німецький прапор і принесіть його.",
      "sourceEnText": "Find the German flag and bring it back.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_029ee72.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3318,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:32:11Z",
      "textHash": "bf70c507f420983eee690fbb247fee3ae04f843f804f6ea5ef10757ee752012e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0324097",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_lux",
      "sourceText": "Ви знайшли прапор Люксембургу! Повертайтеся до Люксембургу.",
      "sourceEnText": "You found the Luxembourg flag! Go back to Luxembourg.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0324097.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
